{
  "claim": "Each of the plugin's four skills, started by its slash command in `claude -p` with the plugin loaded by --plugin-dir, reads <plugin>/skills/teaching.md as its first tool call, before any file of the repository it works on.",
  "source": "Claude Code 2.1.316 (claude CLI on macOS), model claude-sonnet-5-5",
