  "how": "node observations/claude-code/skill-reads-teaching.probe.mjs (beside this record). It makes a throwaway git repository holding orders.ts and docs/plans/retry.json, then runs each skill's slash command there with `claude -p --plugin-dir <this repository> --model sonnet --output-format stream-json --verbose --max-turns 4 --tools Read,Glob,Grep --permission-mode default --permission-prompts none`, and prints each tool call in order, with <plugin> and <scratch> for the two folders and whether the call was refused. Each turn calls a model, so Claude Code must be signed in.",
